OL,3,GNEWSAExtended Metro closure ends after
OL,4,Abridge repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe delayed reopening of a rail line
OL,7,Fwill happen on Tuesday after repairs
OL,8,Fwere completed to a Victorian bridge.
OL,10,FTyne and Wear Metro services between
OL,11,FTynemouth and Wallsend on the Tyne and
OL,12,FWear Metro were already suspended when
OL,13,Fan inspection of the bridge in North
OL,14,FShields found it required "immediate
OL,15,Fand substantial repairs".
OL,17,FThe line closure was extended until
OL,18,FThursday but normal services will now
OL,19,Fresume on Tuesday morning after the
OL,20,Frepairs were signed off on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
