OL,3,GNEWSAExtended Metro closure ends after
OL,4,Abridge repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FKevin Storey, operations director at
OL,7,Foperator Nexus, said: "We are pleased
OL,8,Fto say this critical repair work has
OL,9,Fbeen completed earlier than planned."
